WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.884
Welcome to Orbit. Look after yourself. Our focus is should / must / have to.

2
00:00:07.884 --> 00:00:16.767
Use should for advice. Must not expresses a prohibition. Do not have to means something is not necessary.

3
00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.206
Should I drink more water?

4
00:00:19.206 --> 00:00:22.770
She should see a doctor if the pain continues.

5
00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:27.614
You should take regular breaks. It is good advice.

6
00:00:27.614 --> 00:00:37.012
Pause the video and say one example aloud. Now complete the tasks. You can try again and learn from every answer.
